## Summary

Enabling General > Use Precise Cursors changes the Pen pointer to a crosshair on empty canvas, but the pointer still selects the custom Pen join glyph when drawing toward another open path's endpoint. The preference promises a crosshair for the Pen in every state. This is a display-only inconsistency in the join state; the cursor result does not alter artwork.

